cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
title: "model_cultural_comp: mapping LLM cultural alignment onto the Inglehart-Welzel map"
abstract: >-
  Refits the Inglehart-Welzel cultural map from the Integrated Values Surveys
  with a probabilistic PCA over the ten IVS items, then administers the same ten
  items to large language models and projects their responses through the same
  frozen transform the countries go through. Each model-language cell gets a
  bootstrap confidence region, two region-assignment rules, and classifier-free
  headline statistics.
type: software
